<div class="space-y-4">
  <%= framework_heading(4, 'Adaptive icons under themes') %>
  <p class="<%= framework_section_description_classes %>">
    An icon carrying <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>">image--adaptive</code> is repainted with
    the screen's icon paint, keeping only its alpha channel, so it follows the active theme with no markup changes.
    Pick a Style in the screen picker to watch the icons on this page repaint. See
    <%= render DocsRef.new(page: :themes) %> for what else a theme re-points.
  </p>
</div>
